An ancient tome detailing how <a href=\"/wiki/Sel%C3%BBne\" title=\"Selûne\">Selûne</a> came into being with her sister, <a href=\"/wiki/Shar\" title=\"Shar\">Shar</a>. The silver, radiant Selûne and the dark, alluring Shar complemented each other and brought an orderly distinction between light and dark in the universe.]\n</p>\n</div> <h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Notes\"> Notes </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box\">\n<p>See also:\n</p>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/The_War_between_Sel%C3%BBne_and_Shar\" title=\"The War between Selûne and Shar\">The War between Selûne and Shar</a></li></ul>\n</div>   \n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20260714223610\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: [vary‐revision‐sha1, no‐toc]\nCPU time usage: 0.046 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.049 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 1359/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 23526/4194304 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 5388/4194304 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 22/200\nExpensive parser function count: 1/750\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 2/5000000 bytes\nExtLoops count: 0/1000\nLua time usage: 0.010/7.000 seconds\nLua memory usage: 934187/52428800 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%   38.818      1 Template:MiscItemPage\n100.00%   38.818      1 -total\n 49.83%   19.343      6 Template:Icon_text\n 44.29%   17.193     15 Template:Trim\n 23.81%    9.243      2 Template:Uid\n 16.01%    6.216      1 Template:Main_only\n 13.67%    5.308      2 Template:Template_style\n 10.98%    4.262      1 Template:Books\n 10.82%    4.202      1 Template:PageSeo\n 10.59%    4.109      2 Template:Hidden_code\n-->\n\n<!-- Saved in parser cache with key bg3wiki:pcache:idhash:3877-0!canonical and timestamp 20260714223610 and revision id 239086. Rendering was triggered because: unknown\n -->\n</div>"}